  "note": "The book interface's type (expansion packet U02). Each source is an unmodified file from the Google Fonts repository (https://github.com/google/fonts, branch main, retrieved 2026-10-09); tools/fonts/subset.py checks its SHA-256 before subsetting. The subsets in this folder are what the game embeds. When new text uses a kanji the subsets lack, tests/unit/book_type.test.mjs fails until the subsets are made again.",
